{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/engineering-3-babel/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Overblog","author":"zitup"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"8b76109f-b1b1-54ec-9084-3f641dd806ce","html":"<p>Babel 是一个 JavaScript 编译器，将 ES205+ 的代码转换成向后兼容的版本。Babel 主要做以下几个事情：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>转换 JS 语法</li>\n<li>补充目标环境缺少的 Polyfill（利用第三方库，比如 core-js）</li>\n<li>源代码转换</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\"><a href=\"#%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>核心概念</h2>\n<h3 id=\"plugins\"><a href=\"#plugins\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Plugins</h3>\n<p>转换代码的插件，指导 Babel 如何对代码进行转换。</p>\n<h3 id=\"presets\"><a href=\"#presets\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Presets</h3>\n<p>Preset 是一组已经包含了各种插件的集合，代替一个一个手动引入插件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"原理\"><a href=\"#%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>原理</h2>\n<p>将 JS 代码转换为 AST，对 AST 应用各种插件进行处理，最终输出编译后的 JS 代码。</p>\n<h3 id=\"流程\"><a href=\"#%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B\" aria-hidden class=\"anchor\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>流程</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>解析</li>\n</ol>\n<p>  将代码转换成 AST</p>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>转换</li>\n</ol>\n<p>  对 AST 进行<strong>深度优先遍历</strong>，对节点进行添加、更新以及移除等操作。这个阶段是插件将要介入的地方。</p>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>生成</li>\n</ol>\n<p>  将上一阶段处理后的 AST 转换为代码</p>","timeToRead":1,"frontmatter":{"title":"Babel","date":"January 14, 2022","spoiler":"前端工程化之 Babel","cta":"JS"},"fields":{"slug":"/engineering-3-babel/","langKey":"en"}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/engineering-3-babel/","previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/browser-2-from-domin-to-page/","langKey":"en","directoryName":"browser-2-from-domin-to-page"},"frontmatter":{"title":"浏览器从输入网址到展示页面都发生了什么？"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/browser-3-event-loop/","langKey":"en","directoryName":"browser-3-event-loop"},"frontmatter":{"title":"浏览器事件循环"}},"translations":[],"translatedLinks":[]}},"staticQueryHashes":["708209134"]}